{"type":"text","timestamp":1791297384376,"sessionID":"ses_eee5b6855ffexnE0LDQzX63RzS","part":{"id":"prt_111a4edc1001jpBSNvWVnKjYHi","messageID":"msg_111a4ec44001bVL4e7Of2GTg5o","sessionID":"ses_eee5b6855ffexnE0LDQzX63RzS","type":"text","text":"All visible tests pass (6/6), and I checked edge cases plus the documented behaviour beyond them.\n\nBugs fixed:\n1. `ledger/money.py:20` – `format_cents` used floor division/modulo on negative cents, giving values like `-$-4.90`; now formats `abs(cents)` so `-310` → `-$3.10`.\n2. `ledger/parse.py:9` – `parse_date` returned `(year, day, month)`; now returns `(year, month, day)`.\n3. `ledger/report.py:23` – `top_items` sorted totals ascending with no tie-break; now sorts by total descending and breaks ties by item name ascending.","time":{"start":1791297383873,"end":1791297384370}}}
